WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Ryu guards standing heavy kick.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.450
The heavy-punch target continuation is also guarded.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.650
JP activates the recorded heavy-punch Level 2 after the guarded target.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.850
JP walks forward to throw during the guarded Super pressure.

5
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.350
The Super supplies automatic hits during the throw sequence.

6
00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:06.850
Delayed standing heavy punch catches the automatic juggle.

7
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:07.850
Medium-plus-heavy-kick OD Torbalan continues the conversion.

8
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.250
Heavy Triglav finishes the route.
